## Final exact-span gate

When `unit_text` is empty, use `ok` only if the complete unit or named metric
is one exact contiguous span in `support_text`. Copy that span without adding,
deleting, reordering, or expanding words. Do not combine fragments from
`specific_endpoint_name`, `endpoint_and_comparator`, or assay context. If no
such exact support span completely names the measurement, return `unsure`.

For example, copy `GSH/GSSG ratio` or `T-helper/T-suppressor ratio` when that
exact phrase occurs in support. Do not add compartment or organ adjectives,
parenthetical abbreviations, method names, or definitions of what a ratio or
index means.
